# Keep the API image build hermetic (apps/api/Dockerfile builds from the repo
# root). Host node_modules are pnpm-symlinked trees: `COPY apps/api ./apps/api`
# would overlay them onto the image's own `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile`
# output and the copy fails ("cannot copy to non-directory" on the symlink
# collision) — and stale host build artifacts must never leak into the image
# (the in-image `pnpm build` is the only compile that counts).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git

# Never part of the API image; keeps the build context small.
apps/mobile/android/.gradle
apps/mobile/android/app/build
apps/mobile/android/build
.planning
